Chr2	Araport11	gene	255247	257568	.	-	.	ID=AT2G01570;Name=AT2G01570;Note=GRAS family transcription factor family protein;curator_summary=Member of the VHIID/DELLA regulatory family. Contains homopolymeric serine and threonine residues%2C a putative nuclear localization signal%2C leucine heptad repeats%2C and an LXXLL motif. Putative transcriptional regulator repressing the gibberellin response and integration of phytohormone signalling. DELLAs repress cell proliferation and expansion that drives plant growth. The protein undergoes degradation in response to GA via the 26S proteasome. RGA1 binds to PIF3 and  inhibits its DNA binding activity and thus affects the expression of PIF3 regulated genes. RGA may be involved in reducing ROS accumulation in response to stress by up-regulating the transcription of superoxide dismutases. Represses GA-induced vegetative growth and floral initiation. Rapidly degraded in response to GA. Involved in fruit and flower development.;symbol=RGA1;Alias=RGA,REPRESSOR OF GA;full_name=REPRESSOR OF GA1-3 1;computational_description=REPRESSOR OF GA1-3 1 (RGA1)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Transcriptional factor DELLA%2C N-terminal (InterPro:IPR021914)%2C Transcription factor GRAS (InterPro:IPR005202)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: GRAS family transcription factor family protein (TAIR:AT1G14920.1)%3B Has 2724 Blast hits to 2666 proteins in 317 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 6%3B Metazoa - 0%3B Fungi - 4%3B Plants - 2709%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 5 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:10713441,PMID:10341448,PMID:9490740,PMID:9215910,PMID:9237632,PMID:11118137,PMID:11606552,PMID:11606551,PMID:11717468,PMID:11877383,PMID:11340177,PMID:11449051,PMID:12011349,PMID:12183174,PMID:11826301,PMID:12492836,PMID:12610625,PMID:12724538,PMID:14615596,PMID:14727029,PMID:14973286,PMID:14963246,PMID:14764903,PMID:14756759,PMID:14760535,PMID:15155881,PMID:15128937,PMID:15173565,PMID:15308775,PMID:16034591,PMID:16212609,PMID:16404575