Chr2	Araport11	gene	385171	387478	.	+	.	ID=AT2G01850;Name=AT2G01850;Note=endoxyloglucan transferase A3;curator_summary=EXGT-A3 has homology to xyloglucan endotransglucosylases/hydrolases (XTHs). Mutants in this gene show a lesion mimic phenotype associated with leaf maturation and a reduction in the number of tertiary veins. Individual tracheary elements in the mutants are shorter%2C but phloem transport activity is not severely affected. EXGT-A3 plays a role in xyloglucan degradation in the differentiating tracheary elements of rosette leaves.;symbol=EXGT-A3;Alias=ATXTH27,XTH27,XYLOGLUCAN ENDOTRANSGLUCOSYLASE/HYDROLASE 27;full_name=endoxyloglucan transferase A3;computational_description=endoxyloglucan transferase A3 (EXGT-A3)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: hydrolase activity%2C acting on glycosyl bonds%2C xyloglucan:xyloglucosyl transferase activity%3B INVOLVED IN: phloem or xylem histogenesis%3B LOCATED IN: endomembrane system%2C cell wall%2C apoplast%3B EXPRESSED IN: 25 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 13 growth stages%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Xyloglucan endotransglucosylase/hydrolase (InterPro:IPR016455)%2C Xyloglucan endo-transglycosylase%2C C-terminal (InterPro:IPR010713)%2C Concanavalin A-like lectin/glucanase%2C subgroup (InterPro:IPR013320)%2C Concanavalin A-like lectin/glucanase (InterPro:IPR008985)%2C Glycoside hydrolase%2C family 16 (InterPro:IPR000757)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: xyloglucan endotransglucosylase/hydrolase 28 (TAIR:AT1G14720.1)%3B Has 2101 Blast hits to 2091 proteins in 291 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 238%3B Metazoa - 0%3B Fungi - 449%3B Plants - 1341%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 73 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:10557219,PMID:10406121,PMID:11673616,PMID:12805598,PMID:15694452,PMID:15720654,PMID:15860011,PMID:18315867,PMID:19139039,locus:2059728;locus_type=protein_coding
