Chr2	Araport11	gene	8415046	8417994	.	+	.	ID=AT2G19430;Name=AT2G19430;Note=DWD (DDB1-binding WD40 protein) hypersensitive to ABA 1;curator_summary=This gene is predicted to encode a protein with a DWD motif. It can bind to DDB1a in Y2H assays%2C and DDB1b in co-IP assays%2C and may be involved in the formation of a CUL4-based E3 ubiquitin ligase. Encodes a component of the putative Arabidopsis THO/TREX complex: THO1 or HPR1 (At5g09860)%2C THO2 (At1g24706)%2C THO3 or TEX1 (At5g56130)%2C THO5 (At5g42920%2C At1g45233)%2C THO6 (At2g19430)%2C and THO7 (At5g16790%2C At3g02950). THO/TREX complexes in animals have been implicated in the transport of mRNA precursors.  Mutants of THO3/TEX1%2C THO1%2C THO6 accumulate reduced amount of small interfering (si)RNA%2C suggesting a role of the putative Arabidopsis THO/TREX in siRNA biosynthesis.;symbol=DWA1;Alias=AtTHO6,THO6;full_name=DWD (DDB1-binding WD40 protein) hypersensitive to ABA 1;computational_description=DWD (DDB1-binding WD40 protein) hypersensitive to ABA 1 (DWA1)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: WD40 repeat 2 (InterPro:IPR019782)%2C WD40 repeat-like-containing domain (InterPro:IPR011046)%2C WD40 repeat%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR019775)%2C WD40-repeat-containing domain (InterPro:IPR017986)%2C WD40/YVTN repeat-like-containing domain (InterPro:IPR015943)%2C WD40 repeat (InterPro:IPR001680)%2C WD40 repeat%2C subgroup (InterPro:IPR019781)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: Transducin/WD40 repeat-like superfamily protein (TAIR:AT3G49660.1)%3B Has 25005 Blast hits to 14147 proteins in 619 species: Archae - 64%3B Bacteria - 4449%3B Metazoa - 9459%3B Fungi - 5655%3B Plants - 2500%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 2878 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:15010618,PMID:15937229,PMID:18223036,PMID:20525848,PMID:20634427,PMID:20687615,locus:2047635;locus_type=protein_coding
