Chr2	Araport11	gene	16598072	16603319	.	-	.	ID=AT2G39800;Name=AT2G39800;Note=delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase 1;curator_summary=encodes a delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase that catalyzes the rate-limiting enzyme in the biosynthesis of proline. Gene is expressed in reproductive organs and tissues under non-stress conditions but in the whole plant under water-limiting condition. Expression is also induced by abscisic acid and salt stress in a light-dependent manner. encodes a delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase that catalyzes the rate-limiting enzyme in the biosynthesis of proline. Gene is expressed in reproductive organs and tissues under non-stress conditions but in the whole plant under water-limiting condition. Expression is also induced by abscisic acid and salt stress in a light-dependent manner. P5CS1 appears to be involved in salt stress responses related to proline accumulation%2C including protection from reactive oxidative species. P5CS1 appears to be present in different cells and/or different subcellular locations from P5CS2 in a tissue-dependent manner.;symbol=P5CS1;Alias=ATP5CS;full_name=delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase 1;computational_description=delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase 1 (P5CS1)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthetase activity%3B INVOLVED IN: in 9 processes%3B LOCATED IN: chloroplast%2C membrane%2C cytoplasm%3B EXPRESSED IN: 6 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: C globular stage%2C D bilateral stage%2C E expanded cotyledon stage%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Glutamate 5-kinase (InterPro:IPR001057)%2C Aspartate/glutamate/uridylate kinase (InterPro:IPR001048)%2C Glutamate 5-kinase%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR019797)%2C Aldehyde dehydrogenase%2C N-terminal (InterPro:IPR016162)%2C Gamma-glutamyl phosphate reductase GPR%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR020593)%2C Aldehyde dehydrogenase%2C C-terminal (InterPro:IPR016163)%2C Aldehyde/histidinol dehydrogenase (InterPro:IPR016161)%2C Delta l-pyrrol