Chr2	Araport11	mRNA	16598167	16603059	.	-	.	ID=AT2G39800.2;Parent=AT2G39800;Name=AT2G39800.2;Note=delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase 1;curator_summary=This splice variant is not translated into a protein. Transgenic plants with a c-terminal fusion of YFP to either the full length P5CS1 cDNA or the exon 3-skip cDNA were constructed. The exon 3-skip cDNA could not drive expression of fusion protein while the full length cDNA could do so. Also%2C the full length cDNA could increase proline when expressed in p5cs1 mutant background while expression of the exon 3-skip cDNA did not. Thus several lines of evidence show that At2g39800.2 does not encode any protein.;conf_class=2;symbol=P5CS1;Alias=ATP5CS;full_name=delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase 1;computational_description=delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase 1 (P5CS1)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: delta1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthetase activity%3B INVOLVED IN: in 9 processes%3B LOCATED IN: chloroplast%2C membrane%2C cytoplasm%3B EXPRESSED IN: 6 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: C globular stage%2C D bilateral stage%2C E expanded cotyledon stage%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Glutamate 5-kinase (InterPro:IPR001057)%2C Glutamate 5-kinase%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR019797)%2C Aspartate/glutamate/uridylate kinase (InterPro:IPR001048)%2C Aldehyde dehydrogenase%2C N-terminal (InterPro:IPR016162)%2C Gamma-glutamyl phosphate reductase GPR%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR020593)%2C Aldehyde dehydrogenase%2C C-terminal (InterPro:IPR016163)%2C Delta l-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthetase (InterPro:IPR005766)%2C Gamma-glutamyl phosphate reductase GPR (InterPro:IPR000965)%2C Aldehyde/histidinol dehydrogenase (InterPro:IPR016161)%2C Aldehyde dehydrogenase (InterPro:IPR015590)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: delta 1-pyrroline-5-carboxylate synthase 2 (TAIR:AT3G55610.1)%3B Has 35333 Blast hits to 34131 proteins in 2444 species: Archae - 798%3B Bacteria - 22429%3B Metazoa - 974%3B Fungi - 991%3B Plants - 531%3B Vir