Chr2	Araport11	gene	19003158	19005732	.	-	.	ID=AT2G46280;Name=AT2G46280;Note=TGF-beta receptor interacting protein 1;curator_summary=Encodes a homolog of mammalian TGF-beta receptor interacting protein.  Co-immunoprecipitates with BRI1 and can be phosphorylated in vitro by BRI1 at specific sites (Thr-14%2C Thr-89%2C and either Thr-197 or Ser-198).  May therefore be a cytoplasmic BRI1 substrate and involved in brassinosteroid regulated plant growth and development.The encoded protein has two DWD motifs. It can bind to DDB1a in Y2H assays%2C and DDB1b in co-IP assays%2C and may be involved in the formation of a CUL4-based E3 ubiquitin ligase;symbol=TRIP-1;Alias=TIF3I1,TRIP1;full_name=TGF-beta receptor interacting protein 1;computational_description=TGF-beta receptor interacting protein 1 (TRIP-1)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: protein binding%2C nucleotide binding%3B INVOLVED IN: response to cadmium ion%2C response to salt stress%3B LOCATED IN: CUL4 RING ubiquitin ligase complex%3B EXPRESSED IN: male gametophyte%2C guard cell%2C root%2C cultured cell%2C pollen tube%3B EXPRESSED DURING: L mature pollen stage%2C M germinated pollen stage%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: WD40 repeat 2 (InterPro:IPR019782)%2C WD40 repeat%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR019775)%2C WD40 repeat (InterPro:IPR001680)%2C G-protein beta WD-40 repeat%2C region (InterPro:IPR020472)%2C WD40 repeat-like-containing domain (InterPro:IPR011046)%2C WD40-repeat-containing domain (InterPro:IPR017986)%2C WD40/YVTN repeat-like-containing domain (InterPro:IPR015943)%2C WD40 repeat%2C subgroup (InterPro:IPR019781)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: Transducin/WD40 repeat-like superfamily protein (TAIR:AT2G46290.1)%3B Has 49007 Blast hits to 22277 proteins in 692 species: Archae - 72%3B Bacteria - 7331%3B Metazoa - 19078%3B Fungi - 11080%3B Plants - 5389%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 6057 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:7566156,PMID:11042177,PMID:12114578,PMID:11359608,PMID:15998311,PMID:16502469,PMID:1702